expect Codex · GPT-6.1 Terra
expect Usage limit
expect hit your usage limit
expect Missing
tap Connection check:
expect 2 INCIDENTS
expect OpenCode
shot connections-models-trouble-cover
key BACK
# GitHub (Boss, 2026-10-30): a device whose login expired is an incident naming it and the fix; signing in is his, so no Restore.
tap GitHub login
tap Connections
tap Connection check:
expect gh auth login
absent [ Restore ]
shot connections-github-login-cover
key BACK
